	'keb37b12b' => 'What it covers',
	'kec7ebd14' => 'Pay run for up to 5 staff, payslips, contribution filing, one named clerk.',
	'ked665312' => 'Each further employee',
	'ked9be323' => 'Our bureau operates on clear, transparent pricing with no hidden seat licenses or unexpected maintenance fees. Every rate is published in EUR, quoted excluding VAT, and structured to support businesses with 3 to 60 staff.',
	'kee68aacb' => 'Every payroll calculation is verified through our mandatory two-person check. After your assigned clerk compiles gross wages, allowances, withholding tax, and social contributions, a second senior colleague independently examines the calculation sheet. This peer review inspects contract parameters, rate updates, and deduction formulas, eliminating oversights before the payroll summary is delivered to you for final approval on the 23rd.',
	'kef1e241e' => 'Tomás Verbeek',
	'kf0f3db8a' => 'Starters and leavers in the cycle',
	'kf1750d84' => 'Our one-off switching fee of €350 covers complete technical onboarding and administrative migration. Ama Owusu transfers employee master data, historical wage records, sectoral classifications, and holiday quotas. The fee also includes a comprehensive parallel pay run during your initial transition month, ensuring calculations match your previous system before we take full responsibility for your regular monthly filings.',
	'kf3110600' => 'Each month',
	'kf34f75fd' => 'How does the two-person check work during the calculation cycle?',
	'kf3684ac4' => 'Moving your payroll to Getsuji Payroll is completed in a single month under our fixed €350 one-off switching fee. Ama Owusu supervises your transition from start to finish. During your first month, we run your payroll calculations in parallel alongside your outgoing payroll provider or existing internal records. This side-by-side run verifies that salary codes, seniority scales, tax deductions, and accrued holiday balances align down to the cent before our bureau assumes full operational responsibility for your monthly submissions.',
	'kf3a48bc5' => 'We will call within one working day',
	'kf3f7a295' => 'Hand us the timecards on the 20th. Everyone is paid on the 25th.',
	'kf5276ff0' => 'The switching fee is €350 one-off. Ask us how the parallel month works.',
	'kf5792d80' => 'We operate entirely on rolling monthly agreements with no long-term lock-in clauses. You may conclude our engagement at any point simply by providing one month\'s notice. We believe small business owners should remain with our bureau because of personal service and reliable two-person checks rather than restrictive contract terms. Historical payroll records are organized and provided cleanly if your business transitions.',
